From a4d9ebf4469446639ef689576e2a1057bbdbd9d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 14:56:58 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 060/638] blink: contain the system GetNodeName macro

AI_PHASE: Phase 3 - single-process headless shell

AI_STATUS: Blink WebAudio now retains its AudioNode::GetNodeName C++ API when system headers define the same function-like macro.

ROOT_CAUSE: AROS exec/nodes.h reaches Blink through pthread/libstdc++ headers and expands GetNodeName() declarations and calls as an Exec Node macro.

FIX_REASON: Undefine the colliding macro at the header that owns the C++ identifier, preserving the interface and containing system namespace leakage.

SCOPE: third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/audio_node.h only.

VALIDATION: The complete 93-action WebAudio archive built successfully for AROS.

RISK: Translation units including audio_node.h can no longer use the legacy system GetNodeName macro afterward; Blink has no such dependency.

AI_DECISION_CHAIN: ACD-chromium-native-port-roadmap
---
 third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/audio_node.h | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/audio_node.h b/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/audio_node.h
index 0b8181f02b..8ec9d933c5 100644
--- a/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/audio_node.h
+++ b/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/webaudio/audio_node.h
@@ -34,6 +34,12 @@
 #include "third_party/blink/renderer/platform/heap/collection_support/heap_hash_set.h"
 #include "third_party/blink/renderer/platform/heap/prefinalizer.h"
 
+// Some system headers expose this identifier as a function-like macro. Blink
+// owns it as an AudioNode method throughout the WebAudio implementation.
+#ifdef GetNodeName
+#undef GetNodeName
+#endif
+
 namespace blink {
 
 class BaseAudioContext;
